# Every file here is shipped byte-for-byte.
#
# The .txt prompts carry a UTF-8 BOM and CRLF on purpose: Notepad on Windows renders
# them correctly that way, and the prompts contain em dashes, a Chinese project name
# and a redirected Documents path.  The .md prompts are LF.  `-text` disables git's
# line-ending conversion for everything, so a clone gives back exactly these bytes.
# Diffs still work normally.
* -text
